<section class="ws" id="pm-stake">
  <div class="ws-wrap">
    <div class="ws-head">
      <h2 class="sec-h"><span class="accent">What&rsquo;s at Stake.</span> What Pinemoor Prevents Against:</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">These are the most common diseases currently spreading through ticks &mdash; and what they could mean for you if you get bit by a tick.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ws-list">

      <details class="ws-item">
        <summary class="ws-sum">
          <span class="ws-thumb"><img src="{{ 'pm-portfolio-1-udq2-f86f3.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Lyme disease" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="120" height="68"></span>
          <span class="ws-titles"><span class="ws-name">Lyme Disease</span><span class="ws-tag">~476K cases / year</span></span>
          <span class="ws-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ws-body">
          <ul class="ws-points">
            <li><strong>Joint pain, brain fog &amp; crushing fatigue</strong></li>
            <li>Treatable when caught early &mdash; but easily missed</li>
            <li>Left undiagnosed it can become a <strong>lifelong condition</strong> in the joints &amp; nervous system</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="ws-item">
        <summary class="ws-sum">
          <span class="ws-thumb"><img src="{{ 'pm-perfect-pan-seared-ribeye-steak-50-64c78.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Alpha-gal syndrome" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="120" height="120"></span>
          <span class="ws-titles"><span class="ws-name">Alpha-Gal Syndrome</span><span class="ws-tag ws-tag--alarm">No known cure</span></span>
          <span class="ws-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ws-body">
          <ul class="ws-points">
            <li><strong>You can no longer eat meat</strong> &mdash; red meat, dairy &amp; gelatin trigger reactions for life</li>
            <li><strong>There is no cure</strong> and no treatment &mdash; only lifelong avoidance</li>
            <li>One lone star tick bite is all it takes &mdash; cases up ~5&times; since 2010</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="ws-item">
        <summary class="ws-sum">
          <span class="ws-thumb"><img src="{{ 'pm-getimageattachment-de53e.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Powassan virus" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="120" height="146"></span>
          <span class="ws-titles"><span class="ws-name">Powassan Virus</span><span class="ws-tag ws-tag--alarm">~10% fatal</span></span>
          <span class="ws-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ws-body">
          <ul class="ws-points">
            <li>Causes dangerous <strong>brain swelling (encephalitis)</strong></li>
            <li>Can transmit in <strong>as little as 15 minutes</strong></li>
            <li>Survivors are often left with <strong>permanent neurological damage</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="ws-item">
        <summary class="ws-sum">
          <span class="ws-thumb"><img src="{{ 'pm-0-vicky-archer-4e445.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Rocky Mountain Spotted Fever" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="120" height="80"></span>
          <span class="ws-titles"><span class="ws-name">Rocky Mtn. Spotted Fever</span><span class="ws-tag ws-tag--alarm">Fatal within days</span></span>
          <span class="ws-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ws-body">
          <ul class="ws-points">
            <li>Spread by the common <strong>dog tick</strong></li>
            <li>Rapid onset &mdash; high fever, rash &amp; organ damage</li>
            <li><strong>Can be fatal within days</strong> without fast antibiotics</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>

    <div class="ws-cta">
      <button type="button" class="btn-primary" onclick="pmScrollTop(event)">Try Pinemoor Today</button>
      <p class="guarantee-line"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg> Lifetime money-back guarantee</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Skip layout+paint for this section while it is far offscreen.
     `auto` lets the browser swap in the real height after first render. */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }}{content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 700px;}

  .ws{background:#fff;padding:34px 16px 38px;}
  .ws-wrap{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;}
  .ws-head{margin-bottom:22px;}
  .ws-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;}
  .ws-item{background:#fff;border:1.4px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;}
  .ws-sum{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:13px 15px;}
  .ws-sum::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  .ws-thumb{flex:none;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:#0e0e0e;}
  .ws-thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
  .ws-titles{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;}
  .ws-name{font-family:var(--font-head);font-weight:500;font-size:18px;color:#000;line-height:1.15;}
  .ws-tag{align-self:flex-start;font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:normal;
    text-transform:none;color:var(--muted);background:transparent;padding:0;border-radius:0;}
  .ws-tag--alarm{color:#9a3b22;background:transparent;}
  .ws-plus{flex:none;width:16px;height:16px;position:relative;}
  .ws-plus::before,.ws-plus::after{content:"";position:absolute;background:var(--green-deep);border-radius:2px;transition:opacity .2s;}
  .ws-plus::before{left:50%;top:0;width:2px;height:16px;transform:translateX(-50%);}
  .ws-plus::after{top:50%;left:0;height:2px;width:16px;transform:translateY(-50%);}
  .ws-item[open] .ws-plus::before{opacity:0;}
  .ws-body{padding:0 15px 16px 87px;}
  .ws-points{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}
  .ws-points li{position:relative;padding-left:18px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);}
  .ws-points li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:8px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green-bright);}
  .ws-points strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;}
  .ws-cta{margin-top:24px;max-width:430px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;text-align:center;}

  @media (max-width:420px){ .ws-body{padding-left:15px;} }
</style>

